    "text": "Equation of circle assuming <math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> as<br />centre and radius equal to <math><mn>2</mn></math> units is <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />equation of given circle is <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mo>–</mo></math> equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> gives<br /><math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />which is the required equation"
